# Local deploy configuration — holds Snowflake credentials. The repo root
# .gitignore already covers `.env`; repeated here so the cdk/ subtree is protected
# on its own (e.g. if this directory is ever copied or vendored elsewhere).
# `.env.example` is the committed template and must stay tracked.
.env
!.env.example

